  "prefLabel": "Cub 310.02 Appeal of Current Use Assessed Value",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cub 310.02 Appeal of Current Use Assessed Value. A landowner aggrieved by the current use assessed value may file an abatement request with the municipal assessing officials pursuant to RSA 76:16 and Cub 304.10.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cub 300) #12857-B, eff 8-23-19",
